dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.1.a,"Wait. I'm a person, not one of those things."
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.1.b,"Easy. I'm breathing, see? Those things don't."
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.1.c,Stop. I'm alive. Look at me.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.1.d,Listen. I got dropped in here same as you.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.1.e,"Hold on. I'm flesh and blood, like you."
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.1.comic,"Don't swing. I'm real, which surprised me too."
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.1.overconfident,"Relax. I'm one of the good ones, obviously."
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.1.thrill,"Hell of an entrance. I'm human, don't panic."
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.1.butcher,Careful where you aim. I bleed like you do.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.1.misanthrope,"Yes, I'm one of you. Sorry about that."
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.1.arrogant,Lower your arms. Do I look like a corpse?
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.1.loner,Stay there. I'm no threat to you.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.1.tender,It's all right. I won't hurt you.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.1.greedy,"Nothing on me worth taking, I swear."
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.1.craven,"Please, please. I'm not one of them."
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.1.protector,Steady now. Nobody needs to get hurt.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.1.honourable,"I'll be fair with you. I'm living, and harmless."
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.1.hopeful,"Oh, thank goodness. I'd nearly given up."
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.1.generous,"Here. I'm no danger, and I'll share what I find."
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.1.formal,Do not strike. I mean you no harm.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.2.a,You looked like one of those things.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.2.b,Then stand still where I can see you.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.2.c,Fine. You look as lost as I am.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.2.d,I nearly hit you. Where did you come from?
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.2.e,How long have you been down here?
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.2.comic,Great. A stranger in a dungeon. Very normal.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.2.overconfident,"Lucky for you, I check before I swing."
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.2.thrill,"Shit, I almost had you. Where'd you spring from?"
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.2.butcher,Another second and I'd have opened you up.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.2.misanthrope,We'll see. Folk turn on you fast down here.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.2.arrogant,Amateurs don't last long here. Where were you?
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.2.loner,Keep your distance. Talk from there.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.2.tender,Hey. It's all right. You're safe for now.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.2.greedy,Anything on you worth having? No? Pity.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.2.craven,"God, you scared me. Don't do that again."
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.2.protector,"Steady. Slowly now, tell me where you came from."
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.2.honourable,That's fair. I don't hit people who talk first.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.2.hopeful,Someone else made it. That's good news.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.2.generous,"Here, sit a moment. Get your breath back."
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.2.formal,Forgive me. One cannot be too careful here.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.3.a,Your fight came through the wall. I stayed put.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.3.b,Woke up right here. Haven't moved since.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.3.c,Been hiding here since the noise started.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.3.d,"When it went quiet, I heard your footsteps."
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.3.e,"Sat here, waiting. Then you came."
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.4.a,I won't last alone down here. Let me come.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.4.b,Two of us stand a better chance. Let me walk with you.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.4.c,"Don't leave me here. I'll keep up, I promise."
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.4.d,Take me with you. I can fight if I have to.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.4.e,Can I come along? I can't do this by myself.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.4.comic,"I'm awful company, but I'm cheaper than a coffin."
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.4.overconfident,You'll want me with you. I'm good at this.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.4.thrill,Let me come. I want a piece of the next one.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.4.butcher,Bring me. I'm useful when things need killing.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.4.misanthrope,Trust you? No. But I'm coming anyway.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.4.arrogant,"Frankly, you need someone who knows what they're doing."
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.4.loner,"Normally I'd rather go on my own. Not here, though."
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.4.tender,We should look after each other. Let me stay close.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.4.greedy,"Fifty-fifty on what we find, and I'm with you."
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.4.craven,Please. I'll stay right behind you the whole way.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.4.protector,Keep me near. Whatever hits you hits me first.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.4.honourable,I'll do my share of the fighting. You have my word.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.4.hopeful,Together we might actually make it out.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.4.generous,Anything I find is yours. Let me come along.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.4.formal,Might I travel with you? I would be grateful.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.5.a,Stay close and don't run.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.5.b,"Behind me, then, and watch the corners."
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.5.c,"Come on, then. Keep up and keep quiet."
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.5.d,All right. You walk where I can see you.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.5.e,Then it's two of us. Keep pace.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.5.comic,"Fine. If we die, I'm blaming you."
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.5.overconfident,Sure. Keep back and learn something.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.5.thrill,Hell yes. Try to keep up.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.5.butcher,Good. Stay out of my way when it starts.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.5.misanthrope,Don't make me regret it.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.5.arrogant,Try not to slow me down.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.5.loner,Just don't crowd me.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.5.tender,Of course. Nobody gets left alone down here.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.5.greedy,Deal. But I get first pick of everything.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.5.craven,Yes. Good. Keep looking back for me.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.5.protector,"With me. Steady steps, and I go first."
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.5.honourable,Agreed. We fight fair and bury our dead.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.5.hopeful,"Together, then. We'll get each other out."
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.5.generous,Happily. What's mine is yours down here.
dialogue.second-fresh-meat-greeting.5.formal,Very well. We shall manage between us.
dialogue.floor1-boss.see.1,Is that a man in there?
dialogue.floor1-boss.see.2,"He blinked. I think he blinked."
dialogue.floor1-boss.see.3,"That's the smith. Of course it's the smith."
dialogue.floor1-boss.see.4,Someone's having a worse day than us.
dialogue.floor1-boss.swallowed.1,"Great. Now there's two of us in here."
dialogue.floor1-boss.swallowed.2,"Move over, smith."
dialogue.floor1-boss.freed.1,Out you come. Breathe.
dialogue.floor1-boss.freed.2,"You owe us a sword. A good one."
dialogue.floor1-boss.freed.3,Still in one piece? Mostly?
dialogue.floor1-boss.smith.1,"Three days I held that pose. Three days."
dialogue.floor1-boss.smith.2,"Don't stand there gawping. Get me to a forge."
dialogue.captain-crew.whipped.1,"Ow! Moving, Captain, moving!"
dialogue.captain-crew.whipped.2,"Not me, you lacquered lunatic!"
dialogue.captain-crew.whipped.3,"Alright! I'm going, I'm going!"
dialogue.captain-crew.whipped.4,"One day that arm comes off."
